{}

# ================================================================ S2 content & recordings (examples)
### Trainer: add content (multipart; a link type takes `url` instead of `file`)
POST {{base}}/api/v1/content-items
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=x

--x
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="title"

Regression notes
--x
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="content_type"

PDF
--x
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="topic_id"

1
--x
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="batch_id"

1
--x
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="notes.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./notes.pdf
--x--

### Staff: list content (comma-separated statuses give the review queue)
GET {{base}}/api/v1/content-items?status=Submitted,Under%20Review
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Coordinator: review (start | approve | request_changes | reject); release:true approves and releases
POST {{base}}/api/v1/content-items/1/review
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"decision": "approve", "release": true, "comment": "Good"}

### Student: released resources, recordings, access dates
GET {{base}}/api/v1/me/resources?content_type=PDF
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET {{base}}/api/v1/me/recordings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET {{base}}/api/v1/me/access
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Coordinator: register, release, hold a recording
POST {{base}}/api/v1/recordings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"session_id": 1, "media_ref": "drive:file-id", "duration_minutes": 120}

###
POST {{base}}/api/v1/recordings/1/hold
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"reason": "Whiteboard shows sample PII"}

### Student: request an extension; coordinator / branch manager decides
POST {{base}}/api/v1/access-extension-requests
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"enrolment_id": 1, "scope": "Both", "reason": "Revising for interviews"}

###
POST {{base}}/api/v1/access-extension-requests/1/decision
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"decision": "approve", "note": "Verified"}
